      {
        "id": "tb-uart-definition",
        "moduleId": "role-and-wiring",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：点对点的异步串行通信单元",
        "markdown": "UART 是 **Universal Asynchronous Receiver Transmitter**（通用异步收发器）的缩写，也就是传统上所说的串口（serial port），是最常用的通信方式之一。与前面几节的多点总线不同，UART 使用直接的点对点（point-to-point）通信。\n\n它通常被视为微控制器内部实现的通信单元，而不是一套完整的通信协议。发送端通过 TxD 引脚逐位送出比特流，接收端通过 RxD 引脚接收同一串比特。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-84c289b92b9ee9ffcf19c83c",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000299"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Hello World!",
                "UART"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5108,
              "lineEnd": 5120,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/1e0410b1a27fad4a2ff7d3a34a49741abe963cbd46bd8fa65c62dc32b9a68fc0.jpg",
                "parts/part-0002/images/c0228492dca83e843edcbf1f785780c240b257aacfddd1829804e123b61a6f12.jpg",
